  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"infobox geography vcard\" style=\"width:22em; font-size:88%;\"><tbody><tr class=\"adr\">\n         <th colspan=\"3\" class=\"mergedtoprow\" style=\"text-align:center;padding:0.25em 0.33em 0.33em;line-height:1.2em;font-size:1.25em;\"><span class=\"fn org country-name\">Republic of Iran</span><br /></th>\n       </tr><tr class=\"mergedtoprow\">\n          <td class=\"maptable\" colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;padding:0.5em 0;\"><table style=\"text-align:center;width:100%;background:none;\"><tbody><tr>\n                <td style=\"text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/b/b1/Flag_of_Iran.png/revision/latest?cb=20150815022949\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Flag of Iran\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/b/b1/Flag_of_Iran.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/125?cb=20150815022949\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"125\" height=\"71\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Flag of Iran.png\" data-image-key=\"Flag_of_Iran.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span></td>\n              </tr><tr>\n              <td style=\"text-align:center;font-size:85%;\">Flag</td>\n              </tr></tbody></table>\n          </td>\n        </tr><tr class=\"mergedtoprow\"><td colspan=\"2\"><b>Capital</b><br />and largest city</td><td>Tehran</td></tr><tr>\n         <th colspan=\"2\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;\">National languages</th>\n         <td>English (official), Persian (de facto)</td>\n       </tr><tr>\n         <th colspan=\"2\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;\">Regional languages</th>\n         <td>Azerbaijani, Kurdish, Georgian, Armenian</td>\n       </tr><tr>\n         <th colspan=\"2\">Government</th>\n         <td>Federal presidential constitutional republic</td>\n       </tr><tr class=\"mergedrow\">\n         <td style=\"width:1.0em;padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n         <td style=\"padding-left:0;\">President</td>\n         <td>Hassan-Ali Estahfani</td>\n       </tr><tr class=\"mergedbottomrow\">\n         <td style=\"width:1.0em;padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n         <td style=\"padding-left:0;\">Vice President</td>\n         <td>Abol Sarrans</td>\n       </tr><tr>\n         <th colspan=\"2\">Legislature</th>\n         <td>Congress</td>\n       </tr><tr class=\"mergedrow\">\n         <td style=\"width:1.0em;padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n         <td style=\"padding-left:0;\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Upper_house\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Upper house\">Upper house</a></td>\n         <td>Consultative Assembly</td>\n       </tr><tr class=\"mergedbottomrow\">\n         <td style=\"width:1.0em;padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n         <td style=\"padding-left:0;\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lower_house\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Lower house\">Lower house</a></td>\n         <td>Guardian Council</td>\n       </tr><tr class=\"mergedtoprow\"><th colspan=\"3\">Unification</th></tr><tr class=\"mergedrow\">\n         <td style=\"width:1.0em;padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n         <td style=\"padding-left:0;\">Median Empire</td>\n         <td>678 BCE&#160;</td>\n       </tr><tr class=\"mergedrow\">\n         <td style=\"width:1.0em;padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n         <td style=\"padding-left:0;\">Safavid Dynasty</td>\n         <td>1501&#160;</td>\n       </tr><tr class=\"mergedrow\">\n         <td style=\"width:1.0em;padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n         <td style=\"padding-left:0;\">Islamic Republic</td>\n         <td>April 1, 1979&#160;</td>\n       </tr><tr class=\"mergedbottomrow\">\n         <td style=\"width:1.0em;padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n         <td style=\"padding-left:0;\">Free Association</td>\n         <td>December 4, 2140&#160;</td>\n       </tr><tr class=\"mergedtoprow\">\n         <th colspan=\"3\">Population</th>\n       </tr><tr class=\"mergedrow\">\n            <td style=\"width:1.0em;padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n            <td style=\"padding-left:0;\">2160&#160;estimate</td>\n            <td>&gt;103 Million</td>\n          </tr><tr>\n         <th colspan=\"2\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;\">Currency</th>\n           <td>United States Dollar (USD) </td>\n       </tr></tbody></table>\n<p>The <b>Republic of Iran</b>&#160;or <b>Iran</b> is an <a href=\"/wiki/Associated_state\" title=\"Associated state\">Associated state</a> that fell under the influence of the United States in December 4, 2140 after the <a href=\"/wiki/Third_Mexican-American_War\" title=\"Third Mexican-American War\">Third Mexican-American War</a>. The United States provides defense, funding grants, integration into the Quantum Economic Model, and access to U.S. social services for citizens of these areas of Iran. \n</p><p>It was also the last country on <a href=\"/wiki/Earth\" title=\"Earth\">Earth</a> that became secularized.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Early_History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\"><b>Early History</b></span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Islamic_Republic\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\"><b>Islamic Republic</b></span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Free_Association\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\"><b>Free Association</b></span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Demographics\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Demographics</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Politics\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Politics</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Government\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\"><b>Government</b></span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#President\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\"><b>President</b></span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Administrative_divisions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\"><b>Administrative divisions</b></span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FIran%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Early_History\"><b>Early History</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-br